  - modules/Roster.lua remembered() (:164): first line `local sim = NS.Sim; if sim and sim:IsActive() then local s = sim:Session(); s.mmRoster = s.mmRoster or { byGuid = {}, pets = {}, count = 0 }; return s.mmRoster end`.
