- settings/Slash.lua NS.COMMANDS: after 'export', add `{ 'sim', 'Simulator \226\128\148 a scripted fight through the real meter; try /mm sim', function(a) NS.Sim:RunVerb(a) end }`. It must NOT be in the live-while-disabled set (H7). No launcher entry and no binding.
- The confirm icon: add 'confirm' to the CLAUDE.md `LibKa0s icons:` line (alphabetical, after close). Restore libs/LibKa0s/media/icons/confirm.tga from the vendored tag with `git -C ../LibKa0s show v1.76.0:LibKa0s/media/icons/confirm.tga > libs/LibKa0s/media/icons/confirm.tga` (or the tag the provenance line names). Keep the README icon credit line in step.
