Fill `Host.SCENARIOS.names = { "pull", "boss", "miss", "leave" }` and `defs[name] = { label = L[...], timeline = function(def, opts) return steps end }`. Steps are literal tables of `{ kind, ... , label = L[...], wait? }`, exactly as design-kc-sim §4 lists them.

